Consider the following grammar along with translation rules.
\(S \rightarrow S_1 \# T\) \{S.val = S_1.val * T.val\}
\(S \rightarrow T\) \{S.val = T.val\}
\(T \rightarrow T_1 \% R\) \{T.val = T_1.val \div R.val\}
